WEBVTT

00:02.258 --> 00:02.319
you

00:43.204 --> 00:47.105
We took the pieces from the fire

00:50.446 --> 00:54.027
We pulled the diamonds from the wire

00:57.747 --> 01:03.351
There was a time we had a name Before the fracture

01:03.551 --> 01:08.274
and the flame Now all the colors bleed to white

01:08.614 --> 01:14.378
Beneath this artificial light

01:14.518 --> 01:19.141
We are the fractured prisons In the cold

01:21.675 --> 01:27.719
We bend the light from stories we were told.

01:28.900 --> 01:36.302
I showered glass to catch the morning sun. Look

01:36.402 --> 01:43.566
at the beautiful damage we have done

01:44.106 --> 01:48.808
They built a wall to keep us in They tried to wash

01:49.008 --> 01:54.491
away the sin Boo, every crack inside the stone is

01:54.611 --> 01:59.616
just a path that we have known We hold the edges

01:59.736 --> 02:07.613
sharp and clear There is no room for pity here We

02:07.673 --> 02:08.976
burn the light

02:28.526 --> 02:28.686
We

02:36.511 --> 02:37.612
bend the lights

02:43.596 --> 02:44.657
We bend the lights

02:51.661 --> 02:52.722
We

02:58.765 --> 03:05.009
are

03:05.029 --> 03:09.511
fractured prisms, freezing cold

03:11.852 --> 03:16.255
We bend the light from stories we weren't told

03:18.850 --> 03:26.197
Let's share a glass to catch the morning sun Look

03:26.317 --> 03:30.881
at the beautiful damage we have done

03:37.027 --> 03:40.229
The fracture presents

